{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20263uZmNofYCA1793089358.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地股市四大指數全線下跌。</p><p></p><p>深圳創業板指數跌幅較大，跌逾百分之3。其餘三大指數跌幅約百分之1至2，並以全日低位收市。滬深京三市成交不足1.5萬億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>創新藥和晶片股下跌。銀行和航運股則上升。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T09:22:14.791160+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T08:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T10:58:15.420686+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T09:18:26.802601+00:00","content_hash":"cdad94c33d4faea4339fcedb8b34db2fe72513347c8f6eb737c5ba9f8475afcd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T09:22:14.791160+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}